Package: POISE
Type: Package
Title: Closed-Form One-Step Negative Binomial Rate Ratio Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given  = "Gosuke",
    family = "Homma",
    role   = c("aut", "cre"),
    email  = "my.name.is.gosuke@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Fast, non-iterative estimation of the rate ratio between two
    groups of negative binomial counts. A one-step estimator anchored at
    the Poisson group rates reproduces the negative binomial maximum
    likelihood fit and provides a matching closed-form standard error and
    Wald inference. Additional tools reconstruct the maximum likelihood
    analysis from published group summaries, size trials following the
    method of Tang (2015), and compare operating characteristics of the
    estimators by simulation.
